    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0033",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p031-01530-s001",
      "sentenceText": "So who are these 28.5 percent of Americans who say their lives are meaningful?",
      "sentenceSha256": "f5439c1db81facd0e31488b1a601fab7f29df3cd8b8add6445d7c149f4247fc0",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p031-01530-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "8a05fc85d538902e64b6b54067d4ace2dd18c06624a5dcf132eec17f8e04d5ce",
      "passageSha256": "33d7b2ead3ef693991f8d1b5f93a55290c654b7ac406962cd5190c438f959cb4",
      "pdfPages": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0034",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p031-01530-s002",
      "sentenceText": "For one, they tend to be religious.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c9f65dc5ba3bcfc3c1255c2a87e75425c1ad9f17f1f4d8c3328e9cc6878cfe21",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p031-01530-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "8a05fc85d538902e64b6b54067d4ace2dd18c06624a5dcf132eec17f8e04d5ce",
      "passageSha256": "33d7b2ead3ef693991f8d1b5f93a55290c654b7ac406962cd5190c438f959cb4",
      "pdfPages": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0035",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p031-01530-s004",
      "sentenceText": "When Hurricane Katrina swept away some neighborhoods of New Orleans in 2005, many residents struggled to understand why it happened.",
      "sentenceSha256": "bf055f61095c38af088db2d68ca7ab7b6f9ca1ec4b3a183a7009bbeb7b59fea6",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p031-01530-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "8a05fc85d538902e64b6b54067d4ace2dd18c06624a5dcf132eec17f8e04d5ce",
      "passageSha256": "33d7b2ead3ef693991f8d1b5f93a55290c654b7ac406962cd5190c438f959cb4",
      "pdfPages": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0036",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p031-01530-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Religious people were better able to psychologically deal with this catastrophe than non-religious people.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ed521f49ae1e49d054244a357940f9a192109942805ff6acbbef35e99ab0d860",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p031-01530-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-029",
      "parentFingerprint": "3a3f83152de0b7bad1e1c765262a3131a41467232d893b83645916b850502999",
      "passageSha256": "2e316aa3406c12ae8cb600b9e2f8d82314d045b333329e3de6e4f6d221e953bb",
      "pdfPages": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0037",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p031-03285-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Steger’s research also finds that people who say they have a meaningful life tend to be optimistic about the future, extraverted, non-neurotic, agreeable, conscientious, and have high self-esteem.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3b0369a61731ed2c52593319f4ec898bdab9608c2d772a84b34572f6e484d9cc",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p031-03285-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-030",
      "parentFingerprint": "128cd00e8c0999ec0edf59c799d193fc75b36e7b95223ea0cc42a7fee521256a",
      "passageSha256": "61fb3bd31ee8280961482ff2429c502f2ffa4e44bba4bd2ce12aaf8da7b30cd9",
      "pdfPages": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0038",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p031-03285-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Some well-respected, well-liked, award-winning scientists nonetheless see their lives to be meaningless and die by suicide.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3447335afd814860ced002f691d8461c457cdb378f018f73f28a1a8793724073",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p031-03285-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-030",
      "parentFingerprint": "128cd00e8c0999ec0edf59c799d193fc75b36e7b95223ea0cc42a7fee521256a",
      "passageSha256": "61fb3bd31ee8280961482ff2429c502f2ffa4e44bba4bd2ce12aaf8da7b30cd9",
      "pdfPages": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0039",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p031-03285-s006",
      "sentenceText": "What are you doing?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "cf4a85f74d12500e7a48694ca904ecb1a2e6f9972ed6e013eb3402afb7f273ce",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p031-03285-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-031",
      "parentFingerprint": "a5ac6f95dba173df0f99806275cd5785b45b20a67a93640d17c5b3b63e3cfdf4",
      "passageSha256": "0235cb34bcd88ca74ef9f307a3199098d11cc9121469c5258dda4744d145c8d3",
      "pdfPages": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0040",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p031-05040-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Second, people with high self-esteem are more likely to say that their lives matter than those who do not like themselves.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a561ce3f7d89c111e050c60f4ce2b7db549009c306a7a49b2aebc0ff1f879acc",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p031-05040-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-032",
      "parentFingerprint": "82a60381c1448f87275271845c2c42cb9cafbb36cebf7a79fad41b05cdda5789",
      "passageSha256": "5e6841b3b9bf8873b0df8ce4e861705052d02cc6e64bf369116cd13b1b9da89a",
      "pdfPages": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0041",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p031-05040-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Non-neurotic people (those who don’t worry too much or are not too stress prone) are more likely to say that their lives have a clear purpose and direction than neurotic people.",
      "sentenceSha256": "21199d274a0e34035b4d0c5dd4d0b37ae71ffc5435a3d9fa487337f893abd136",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p031-05040-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-032",
      "parentFingerprint": "82a60381c1448f87275271845c2c42cb9cafbb36cebf7a79fad41b05cdda5789",
      "passageSha256": "5e6841b3b9bf8873b0df8ce4e861705052d02cc6e64bf369116cd13b1b9da89a",
      "pdfPages": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0042",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p031-05040-s005",
      "sentenceText": "They are likely to feel that their lives have a sense of direction, purpose, and meaning.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2a4ed2eb1c70f9c7fc2a282e60654caca85c6b219949364eece77a493c11f897",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p031-05040-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "8fd021f5866e0d8979b1ed04f2eb26c0750eeded32e39fcd82ef5677af324579",
      "passageSha256": "46b40011ed81df69b93850e9e069a3fa9f65a61d1ac12895e5d76856c5c0e44e",
      "pdfPages": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0043",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p032-00750-s001",
      "sentenceText": "These personality traits and attitudes express themselves in predictable ways.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5feae09119dfd73fbc215a0ed3389b9e7680232228a79bdebf466156cbd0fd4c",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p032-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "0e54becf7feedf95825393c7b96d5bb5bee1e91040e8f3e586bfa5d01878acc4",
      "passageSha256": "7522e93f4fb510669a2bd5fc94286f2fe87189c7ccd9a5346d726adce29154c8",
      "pdfPages": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0044",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p032-00750-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Others derive meaning in life from their work, family, and community, again a narrowly defined realm of life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "eae68a01a68b077d80eabc489d865d927481ccf578d70d754028ba8e0e224f4a",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p032-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "0e54becf7feedf95825393c7b96d5bb5bee1e91040e8f3e586bfa5d01878acc4",
      "passageSha256": "7522e93f4fb510669a2bd5fc94286f2fe87189c7ccd9a5346d726adce29154c8",
      "pdfPages": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0045",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s05-p032-02820-s001",
      "sentenceText": "There are some troubling implications, however.",
      "sentenceSha256": "21852020cc7c11d69f938179bec7859f27ec89bec4eaae6bc9015df6cdc33690",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s05-p032-02820-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-036",
      "parentFingerprint": "ef6da660dc8ecb2eaa5d59f0e7840d4603a487f3966cc8bf61f8dad5f62b142a",
      "passageSha256": "99ffe81c96f9e582ab588be593b85ac43e86985bfa1c8081a8020ca802de2299",
      "pdfPages": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0046",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s05-p032-02820-s003",
      "sentenceText": "He cares about U.S. national security dearly.",
      "sentenceSha256": "086dd713d9b91c3337719360fff911a6410ebc791edc7cdaf448017d62c22283",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s05-p032-02820-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-036",
      "parentFingerprint": "ef6da660dc8ecb2eaa5d59f0e7840d4603a487f3966cc8bf61f8dad5f62b142a",
      "passageSha256": "99ffe81c96f9e582ab588be593b85ac43e86985bfa1c8081a8020ca802de2299",
      "pdfPages": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0047",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s05-p032-02820-s005",
      "sentenceText": "He gets assigned to a prison housing mostly those suspected of terrorism.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9bfb662377febae4adf85c1609f70723e58cb04aacd50c05f3e1c00d59cdbefb",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s05-p032-02820-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-037",
      "parentFingerprint": "d6569983e49f3244255051727acdf5426292ad9e50df905d2a0b3d9e53d64996",
      "passageSha256": "c9f49115a3226d608c69388f79c868d65dbaf5b7fe3cc22e5ad64c315ffaddf5",
      "pdfPages": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0048",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s05-p032-04575-s001",
      "sentenceText": "So far, the case of Mason, the military prison officer, is merely hypothetical.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7d69cedbe146f322544ac045218170f6af31e850da51d758a6b0d0bd35779a01",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s05-p032-04575-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-039",
      "parentFingerprint": "aed636f0d2e22d2293f7571f40945ebdcab0f7ac78524647f29b8405727682ec",
      "passageSha256": "505c5bb76570b508c4bd978ed57ce9897982c810168f2737eaf359964a584c64",
      "pdfPages": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0049",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s05-p032-04575-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Is there any scientific evidence for this phenomenon of misplaced meaning in life?",
      "sentenceSha256": "72ef61c59620386b095ead5554b4b2ff26c3af4af4c03eee3d0dc1e2d97f1a10",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s05-p032-04575-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-039",
      "parentFingerprint": "aed636f0d2e22d2293f7571f40945ebdcab0f7ac78524647f29b8405727682ec",
      "passageSha256": "505c5bb76570b508c4bd978ed57ce9897982c810168f2737eaf359964a584c64",
      "pdfPages": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0050",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s05-p032-04575-s005",
      "sentenceText": "They do plenty of civic work, in their way.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6fb7c4ec4a27d0e5ec050b66350819d36f30cfb6234ab460514937f687ec91a7",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s05-p032-04575-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-040",
      "parentFingerprint": "85dc8090709e3f70ea419050b5202ec7cd56780483ccd678d343573fb7373e85",
      "passageSha256": "7ebc90a89a9448787268a6dca9b9a1837ace8dbb3abadb3306d5806659558a52",
      "pdfPages": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0051",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s05-p033-00750-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Or consider the ultimate antisocial behavior, terrorism.",
      "sentenceSha256": "cc45777356572021f1002dbc782ed1be727efdcf5b88b09a4b308a7dc4ebf6ac",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s05-p033-00750-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "3d224a4db4b89df3ee5c2e08508485eade2f836513b3963c8436a6b09633c0bd",
      "passageSha256": "e606ef55725dcd8f0b1fb982e9cb78e7d2eed9cfaa4f61a9eca29718c741f61b",
      "pdfPages": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0052",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s05-p033-00750-s004",
      "sentenceText": "From within this narrative, the fundamental existential questions in life are given a bracingly decisive answer.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "0defb23a0e5c10c633d87b0acd77d72be7d0f1c8a62eae7b8a641217291a8bc0",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s05-p033-00750-r004-005",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-042",
      "parentFingerprint": "a3773fe2260b955566bb7b6eeed352219ef151a57b9b42799d34e672d291a1d0",
      "passageSha256": "c74bda3d5a4b8a8d913d6b781659c3aba9881615e19155d5dca48bc052e770f1",
      "pdfPages": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0053",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s06-p033-03600-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Like the happiness trap, the meaning trap has two parts.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f05e467c63716e70deb5f263ea51c305e486c2291e0a0b4d163a93e4c67ee6e1",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s06-p033-03600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "73ad9d347aedbd5fc1b152d6646f0ef5ce997418769f2faeda82a85f95455fa1",
      "passageSha256": "4b9cbc463287170da00a85656867f1f3b7bff817b7f2231ed33e8c1dce11e2ae",
      "pdfPages": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0054",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s06-p033-03600-s002",
      "sentenceText": "First, for the majority of us who have not invented anything or participated in the Peace Corps, it is easy to feel like a failure in the face of the call to be great.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ee214eabf5eaff1e6371eec9eac3bf342bed14f90d5d27073e7adb25bce1ab8d",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s06-p033-03600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "73ad9d347aedbd5fc1b152d6646f0ef5ce997418769f2faeda82a85f95455fa1",
      "passageSha256": "4b9cbc463287170da00a85656867f1f3b7bff817b7f2231ed33e8c1dce11e2ae",
      "pdfPages": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0055",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s06-p033-03600-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Most of us feel that way once in a while.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9a0ba71b4a3367e2168d2cf0edaaf82da2272684cae5169ede6224c0166c9b90",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s06-p033-03600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "73ad9d347aedbd5fc1b152d6646f0ef5ce997418769f2faeda82a85f95455fa1",
      "passageSha256": "4b9cbc463287170da00a85656867f1f3b7bff817b7f2231ed33e8c1dce11e2ae",
      "pdfPages": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0056",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s06-p033-03600-s008",
      "sentenceText": "As research shows, meaning in life is sometimes attained through prosocial behaviors toward a small ingroup, and antisocial behaviors or apathy toward outgroups.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8a0704dc64673c2ef2aaa2d84d2d847b8a130082247526ccd9435a107a8bc5db",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s06-p033-03600-r005-008",
